WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.768
A tense day in Jerusalem as

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:03.436
thousands of Israeli nationalists

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:04.771
marched through the streets

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:07.140
in a provocative annual flag parade.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:07.941
Far right.

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:09.275
National Security Minister

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:10.410
Itamar Ben Javier

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.879
joined the crowds just a few hours ago.

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:13.646
You can see him there.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:16.082
He's been convicted of supporting

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.751
anti-Palestinian terrorism,

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:19.486
but was greeted here

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:20.720
like a rock star

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:21.554
with some marchers

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:24.357
chanting, the prime minister is here.

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.760
While the march was mostly peaceful,

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.727
but some demonstrators

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.262
threw rocks at journalists

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:31.431
including two of our own.

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:33.800
They also taunted journalists in hijabs,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.302
some shouting, May your village burn.

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:39.072
Two people have been arrested

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:40.507
The annual march celebrates

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:42.342
Israel's capture of East Jerusalem

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:44.377
during the 1967 war.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.146
Israel later annexed the territory

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:46.646
in a move

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:50.116
not recognized under international law.

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:51.751
Let's bring in our CNN

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:54.320
head of skull to his live in Jerusalem.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.288
Husband

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:57.891
today had us clearly a day of tension

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:58.591
in Jerusalem.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:00:59.726
Tell us what you have been

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:00.527
seeing, witnessing

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:01.528
in the last few hours

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:02.495
and the type of people

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:03.863
who've been turning out for this rally.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:06.399
Yeah, Cristina,

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:07.967
this day is called Jerusalem Day.

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.135
As you noted, as the day

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:12.639
when Israeli celebrate Israel capturing

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:15.442
control of East Jerusalem in the 1967

00:01:15.442 --> 00:01:16.676
war captured control

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:17.577
from Jordan

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:18.411
and for Israelis

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:19.145
it's a celebration

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.613
they see it as unifying

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:22.482
their their capital unifying

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:25.552
Jerusalem until 1967 Jews can go to the

00:01:26.052 --> 00:01:26.986
holiest sites

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:28.321
in the old city of Jerusalem

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:29.756
which lies in East Jerusalem.

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:32.392
But for Palestinians who want the east

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:33.326
we want East Jerusalem

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:35.161
as the capital of their future state.

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:36.062
They see this day

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:37.263
is incredibly provocative

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.365
especially because in the last few years

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:41.301
it's essentially become a right

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:42.869
wing nationalistic rally.

00:01:42.869 --> 00:01:46.039
Most of the people who attend this day

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:47.640
tend to be definitely from the right wing

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.209
many from the religious Zionist,

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:50.443
many from

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:52.479
settlers from the occupied West Bank.

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:54.981
And there typically does tend to be

00:01:54.981 --> 00:01:56.950
some sort of scuffles and violence

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.184
and that's what we saw today.

00:01:58.184 --> 00:01:58.885
Not only

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:00.220
a very heavy hand from the police

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.020
that had deployed

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.589
thousands of police officers

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:04.591
to try to keep the calm in some way,

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.793
but also today towards reporters.

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:08.161
We were standing

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:09.462
in the cordoned off area

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:11.531
that the police had set up for reporters

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:14.000
overlooking the Damascus Gate area,

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.335
which is one of the main entrances

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:16.903
to the Muslim quarter.

00:02:16.903 --> 00:02:17.637
Of the Old City.

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:18.571
This is one of the paths

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.273
that the marchers went on.

00:02:20.273 --> 00:02:22.942
And we started to not only get taunts

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:25.778
from the marchers, especially towards

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:27.313
some of our Palestinian

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:28.781
journalist colleagues, things

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:31.551
like May Your Village Burn. We also heard

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:33.686
marchers chanting

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:34.254
things

00:02:34.254 --> 00:02:36.189
about getting revenge on Palestine

00:02:36.189 --> 00:02:37.557
or raising their names.

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:38.424
But also at one point

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:40.293
they started throwing things at us

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:42.061
rocks, bottles, cans.

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:43.429
I saw at least two journalists

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:44.497
get injured.

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:46.099
Many people had to take cover

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:48.134
put on helmets and the like.

00:02:48.134 --> 00:02:49.269
The Israeli police did say

00:02:49.269 --> 00:02:50.136
they ended up arresting

00:02:50.136 --> 00:02:51.004
at least two people

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:52.472
and they're investigating more.

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:52.972
But again,

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:53.506
to show you

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:56.509
that the antagonism wasn't just towards

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:58.978
the Palestinians in the area,

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:01.047
but it was also towards us journalists.

00:03:01.047 --> 00:03:02.615
But other than those events,

00:03:02.615 --> 00:03:04.651
it was largely peaceful.

00:03:04.651 --> 00:03:05.985
And I should say most of the marchers

00:03:05.985 --> 00:03:07.620
there were there just to march

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.988
and dance and dance

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:10.256
around with their flags.

00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:12.158
And it didn't get to the same level,

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:13.860
of course, that we saw in 20, 21.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:14.394
We were there

00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:16.162
covering the same march in 2021,

00:03:16.162 --> 00:03:17.797
and that was when Hamas,

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:18.431
the militant group

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:19.799
that runs Gaza, had threatened that

00:03:19.799 --> 00:03:21.734
if the march was not canceled

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:22.635
then they would respond

00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:24.537
and they did respond with rockets

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:25.405
towards Jerusalem.

00:03:25.405 --> 00:03:26.139
Sirens went off

00:03:26.139 --> 00:03:27.607
as the marchers were on the route,

00:03:27.607 --> 00:03:29.475
and I actually canceled

00:03:29.475 --> 00:03:30.843
the march as a result.

00:03:30.843 --> 00:03:31.744
And that of course set off

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:32.812
that 11 day war

00:03:32.812 --> 00:03:34.247
between the Israeli military

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:35.582
and the militants in Gaza.

00:03:35.582 --> 00:03:37.016
Now while the militant groups in Gaza

00:03:37.016 --> 00:03:37.984
had threatened

00:03:37.984 --> 00:03:39.752
what they called some sort of response

00:03:39.752 --> 00:03:42.121
if unnamed red lines were crossed.

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:42.956
So far

00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:44.190
we haven't seen any sort

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:45.391
of major response

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:46.526
either from Gaza

00:03:46.526 --> 00:03:47.994
or elsewhere as a result.

00:03:47.994 --> 00:03:49.562
But, you know,

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:51.331
we could see something later on,

00:03:51.331 --> 00:03:52.765
but there was little expectation

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:54.667
that there would be a similar response

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:56.002
as we saw in 20, 21.

00:03:57.637 --> 00:03:58.771
And how much

00:03:58.771 --> 00:03:59.839
emphasis is being put

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:00.440
on the fact

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:02.675
of the timing of this march

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:03.810
this time around us?

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.345
I mean, this comes five days

00:04:05.345 --> 00:04:06.045
after a cease

00:04:06.045 --> 00:04:06.746
fire was reached

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:08.948
between Israel and Islamic Jihad.

00:04:09.115 --> 00:04:10.650
What is the situation there now?

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:11.384
You're saying

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:13.386
that the threat of major escalation

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:16.923
is unlikely I mean, is that concern now

00:04:17.457 --> 00:04:19.192
disappearing as night falls

00:04:19.192 --> 00:04:22.495
there as the march concludes?

00:04:22.495 --> 00:04:23.763
Yeah, well, in terms of timing,

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:24.230
this is always

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.498
held on the same day,

00:04:25.498 --> 00:04:26.299
which is on the

00:04:26.299 --> 00:04:28.167
according to the Hebrew calendar

00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:29.335
when this

00:04:29.335 --> 00:04:30.403
when Israel captured

00:04:30.403 --> 00:04:32.372
East Jerusalem in 1967.

00:04:32.372 --> 00:04:33.339
But it is happening,

00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:34.340
as you know just a few days

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:35.942
after a cease fire was reached

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:36.709
between Islamic

00:04:36.709 --> 00:04:38.878
Jihad militants and the Israeli military

00:04:38.911 --> 00:04:39.612
after that

00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:41.147
several day long conflict there.

00:04:41.147 --> 00:04:41.748
And in a way

00:04:41.748 --> 00:04:42.782
I actually think

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:45.051
that probably helped cool the situation.

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:45.885
Having a cease fire

00:04:45.885 --> 00:04:47.220
a few days before helped cool

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.321
the situation on the ground

00:04:48.321 --> 00:04:49.589
because of course

00:04:49.589 --> 00:04:52.892
if the if the conflict was ongoing

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:53.559
with the militants

00:04:53.559 --> 00:04:53.960
in Gaza

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:54.961
and the Israeli military

00:04:54.961 --> 00:04:56.763
while this march was going on,

00:04:56.763 --> 00:04:58.231
I think we could have definitely expected

00:04:58.231 --> 00:04:59.432
some sort of

00:04:59.432 --> 00:05:01.234
major response

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:02.001
from the militants

00:05:02.001 --> 00:05:03.536
there towards Jerusalem.

00:05:03.536 --> 00:05:04.537
Towards this march.

00:05:04.537 --> 00:05:06.072
But that was a major focus

00:05:06.072 --> 00:05:07.340
and a major push

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.708
by those who were trying to get

00:05:08.708 --> 00:05:09.208
that cease

00:05:09.208 --> 00:05:10.743
fire, by the Egyptians, by others,

00:05:10.743 --> 00:05:12.178
knowing that this date was

00:05:12.178 --> 00:05:13.713
was coming very quickly.

00:05:13.713 --> 00:05:16.182
They wanted that ceasefire done before

00:05:16.416 --> 00:05:17.850
today's march Kristie.

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:18.418
All right.

00:05:18.418 --> 00:05:18.751
Had us

00:05:18.751 --> 00:05:20.086
go to appreciate your reporting there

00:05:20.086 --> 00:05:21.921
live from Jerusalem tonight.

00:05:21.921 --> 00:05:22.922
Thank you.

00:05:23.189 --> 00:05:25.358
Well, Palestinians in Gaza are rallying

00:05:25.358 --> 00:05:26.993
against the holding of this parade

00:05:26.993 --> 00:05:29.329
in Jerusalem at the border with Israel.

00:05:29.362 --> 00:05:30.930
These were the scenes earlier.

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.132
Palestinians see the march

00:05:33.132 --> 00:05:34.967
as a provocation, as had us was saying,

00:05:34.967 --> 00:05:35.968
and a threat.

00:05:35.968 --> 00:05:38.404
And in previous years, it has led

00:05:38.638 --> 00:05:39.272
to clashes.

